BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  In the age of the first dawn, the Great Weaver sat at the edge of the Void. She held five stra) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    nds of starlight, the essence of creation. Before her stood the Merchant, a being of shadow ) Tj ET
