BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    into nothingness. If she cast them into the abyss, they would vanish. But if she entrusted t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    hem to the Merchant, the light would multiply threefold in the heat of his forge.) Tj ET
