BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  One cycle, Aethel chose the leap of faith, planting all five seeds. The earth swelled, yieldin) Tj ET
