BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    emembered the winters of cold isolation when no one shared. He saw Aethel, waiting with empt) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    y palms. If he took all, the cycle would end; no more seeds would be offered. If he returned) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (     a portion, the cycle would flourish. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  Thorne chose the path of the flow, returning eight stalks. Aethel smiled, her hands warmed by ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    the grain. From that day, the Valley of Reciprocity thrived, for they learned that a gift ca) Tj ET
