BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  In the dawn of the world, two spirits, Elara and Kael, tended a silver orchard. Elara carried ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    the golden seeds of potential, while Kael held the vessel of growth. When Elara planted her ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    seeds in Kael's garden, they blossomed three times over, for the soil was enchanted by the l) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    aw of reciprocity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  If Elara kept her seeds, the orchard remained barren and silent. If she entrusted them to Kael) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    , the bounty grew tenfold. Yet, the magic required a sacred balance. If Kael claimed the ent) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ire harvest, the soil would turn to ash, and the spirits would grow cold, their connection s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    evered by greed. But when Kael returned half of the golden fruit to Elara, the orchard pulse) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    d with eternal light, and the spirits flourished in harmonious union.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  Thus, the ancients taught that trust is the irrigation of the soul. One must release the seed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    to witness the miracle of multiplication, and one must honor the harvest to ensure the cycle) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (     continues. In the dance of giving and returning, prosperity is not merely found; it is cult) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    ivated through the shared breath of faith. For those who understand that the gain of one is ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    the strength of the other, the orchard provides forever.) Tj ET
