BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      In the dawn of the world, two spirits, Elara and Kael, tended a silver orchard. Elara carr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        ied the golden seeds of potential, while Kael held the vessel of growth. When Elara plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ted her seeds in Kael's garden, they blossomed three times over, for the soil was enchan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ted by the law of reciprocity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      If Elara kept her seeds, the orchard remained barren and silent. If she entrusted them to ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        Kael, the bounty grew tenfold. Yet, the magic required a sacred balance. If Kael claimed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (         the entire harvest, the soil would turn to ash, and the spirits would grow cold, their ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (        connection severed by greed. But when Kael returned half of the golden fruit to Elara, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        he orchard pulsed with eternal light, and the spirits flourished in harmonious union.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      Thus, the ancients taught that trust is the irrigation of the soul. One must release the s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (        eed to witness the miracle of multiplication, and one must honor the harvest to ensure t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        he cycle continues. In the dance of giving and returning, prosperity is not merely found) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        ; it is cultivated through the shared breath of faith. For those who understand that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (         gain of one is the strength of the other, the orchard provides forever.) Tj ET
