BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      Myth: In the celestial workshop of the Architect, two builders sought to span the Great Vo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        id. One held the foundation, the other the mortar. When the foundation was surrendered i) Tj ET
